- You may NOT copy, publish, redistribute, modify, reverse engineer, or create derivative works from the source code without prior written permission.

4) Credits and authorship
- You may NOT remove or alter copyright notices.
- You may NOT claim authorship of this software.

5) Termination
Any violation of this license immediately terminates your right to use this software.

6) No warranty
This software is provided "as is", without express or implied warranties.
The author is not liable for damages, losses, account restrictions, bans, or security incidents resulting from use of this software.

7) Acceptance
By using, copying, or distributing this software, you agree to this license.
